2628658837585375", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622184_2628658840918708_4351558073362754902_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8luGJECAaWkQ7kNvwF2dzhZ&_nc_oc=Adokfgrwzps6oclj8E2desGVifbP1vpyN-a1Dqp6aVYEqih2X8moqanwHOwrqOm_cBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7ixagm7xYU0D_5Mu61k11qN3tPOJ4s4relbZU8TchmA&oe=6AB51B0A"}, "display_name": "Devil's Roulette  -The Pit-", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhere devils congregate, and where guns, luck, mind games, and chaos reign supreme. Welcome to hell's most wanted social club.\n{4597215590501538}\n\n# Test Your Luck, Risk It All \n{942957972101851}\nDevil\u2019s Roulette -The Pit- is a thrilling VR party game for 1 to 8 players!\n\n# Freely Customize \n{1498700681601524}\nFrom luxurious skins to an arsenal of guns and trinkets! Pursue your own style.\n\n\n# Madness-Filled Stages\n{1680610156557317}\nBattle across a multitude of stunning stages, each featuring unique gimmicks.\n\n\n# Join the Discord!!\n{1321917030022011}\nCheck our Discord for the latest news, player interactions, free skin giveaways, and more!\n\nhttps://mydearest.net/DevilsRoulette-BazookaDiscord", "short_description": "Devil's Roulette -The Pit- is a thrilling VR party game for 1 to 8 players, featuring a variety of high-stakes game modes including the new mode 'Devil's Spoons', where the player who collects four matching cards gets to pull the trigger Russian Roulette, Spin the Bottle, card-based bluffing, and more. Ready to go feral?\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Bazooka Studio"